---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
mod: adventure-engine
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

Walk up to a supported structure. A plaque appears with an adventure offer.

- **Y** — accept (only while you are actually **on** the structure; standing in the grass next to it just shows the preview)
- **H** — leave / abandon
- Hold **G** — expand the plaque

Creative mode draws the box if you need to see the bounds. If you walk away, the site goes quiet for a while and you can come back later.

**Ranks** (rolled when the offer first generates): Scout, Adventurer, Veteran, Champion, Legend. Higher rank means a longer timer, harder mobs, better loot, and (for find / sacrifice) a different item list. Pay is a loot table plus vanilla XP.
